Tools: Rocq (formerly Coq)

::: info
(Type theory, Formal system) A **type** defined by a finite set of ${fref("/01-programming-language-theory/02-concepts/constructor.td")}s that specify all possible ways to build its values, enabling ${fref("/01-programming-language-theory/02-concepts/pattern-matching.td")} and ${fref("/01-programming-language-theory/02-concepts/structural-recursion.td")} (like `nat`, `list`, or `tree`).
:::
